OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANvidia hires major US law firm to
OL,4,Ainvestigate alleged Chinese spy affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia said on Tuesday that it had
OL,7,Fhired New York law firm Wachtell,
OL,8,FLipton, Rosen & Katz, and that its
OL,9,Fattorney Joon Kim would lead "a
OL,10,Fthorough and independent
OL,11,Finvestigation". The FBI is also
OL,12,Fconducting its own probe.
OL,14,FThe company's share price has fallen
OL,15,Falmost to a yearly low, with $500bn
OL,16,F(#375bn) wiped of its stock market
OL,17,Fvalue since Friday.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
