OL,5,
OL,6,FTV presenter AJ Odudu, comedian Jack
OL,7,FSkipper, Love Island contestant Chloe
OL,8,FBurrows and model Leomie Anderson round
OL,9,Fout the team headed for Australia.
OL,11,FHosts Ant and Dec will return with the
OL,12,FITV show's opening episode on Monday,
OL,13,F16 November, with the series now in its
OL,14,F26th year.
